WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.123 --> 00:00:03.477
(car engine whirring)

00:00:03.477 --> 00:00:06.394
(car door opening)

00:00:08.038 --> 00:00:10.788
(car door slams)

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:13.420
- Eric.

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:14.440
Wait.

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:16.200
Are you sure you want to go in like this?

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:17.620
- Yes.

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:18.940
- Are you sure you're sure?

00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:20.310
- Yes!

00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:21.564
Why? What's wrong with it?

00:00:21.564 --> 00:00:22.800
(car honking)

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:25.096
- Wait a second, please.

00:00:25.096 --> 00:00:27.150
When I first came to this country--

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:27.983
- Dad!

00:00:27.983 --> 00:00:30.430
- I had to do so much to fit in.

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:31.263
(sighs)

00:00:31.263 --> 00:00:32.720
I never wanted the same for my children.

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:33.553
- Okay.

00:00:33.553 --> 00:00:36.023
- I wanted you to be proud and strong.

00:00:37.220 --> 00:00:39.493
But you are so different.

00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:43.230
It makes me feel scared for you.

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:45.370
- Your fear doesn't help me, Dad.

00:00:45.370 --> 00:00:46.493
Makes me feel weak.

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:49.063
- But why...

00:00:50.470 --> 00:00:52.653
do you have to be so much?

00:00:53.890 --> 00:00:54.763
- This is me.

00:00:57.460 --> 00:00:59.106
- I don't want you to be hurt.

00:00:59.106 --> 00:01:01.403
- (scoffs) I'll be hurt either way.

00:01:02.340 --> 00:01:03.753
Isn't better to be who I am?

00:01:05.406 --> 00:01:06.310
(car honking)

00:01:06.310 --> 00:01:07.423
- I told you to wait!

00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:14.267
I just shouted at that man.

00:01:16.086 --> 00:01:19.340
- Yeah. (laughs)

00:01:19.340 --> 00:01:22.740
Yeah, you did. (laughs)

00:01:22.740 --> 00:01:23.650
- Maybe...

00:01:25.110 --> 00:01:27.033
I am learning from my brave son.

00:01:27.954 --> 00:01:30.537
(gentle music)

00:01:31.679 --> 00:01:36.312
- Dad. (laughing)

00:01:46.036 --> 00:01:49.203
(high heels clacking)

00:01:55.630 --> 00:01:57.800
- [Adam] What the fuck did you
come as, Tromboner, a girl?

00:01:57.800 --> 00:01:58.900
- [Eric] What do you want, Adam?

00:01:58.900 --> 00:02:00.350
- I'm gonna fucking kill you.

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:02.933
- Okay.

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:06.150
Are you gonna do it now or later?

00:02:06.150 --> 00:02:07.633
Because I'm ready when you are.

00:02:09.386 --> 00:02:10.380
- It's comin'.

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:11.213
- Okay.

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:13.373
So later then?

00:02:14.510 --> 00:02:16.159
Great.

00:02:16.159 --> 00:02:18.742
(upbeat music)

00:02:20.045 --> 00:02:23.212
(high heels clacking)

00:02:26.219 --> 00:02:29.636
♪ I've gone away forever ♪

